    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>j</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>j</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>The,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"right\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math