up><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msup><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>108</mn></math></p>",
